
{"id":"76fce5c5-46fc-4903-a08f-88ad88219e33","object":"chat.completion","created":1785014956,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"```json\n{\n  \"implementation\": \"def solve(case):\\n    import collections\\n    edges = case['edges']\\n    communities_in = case['communities']\\n    gamma = case['resolution']\\n    nodes = sorted(communities_in.keys())\\n    adj = {n: {} for n in nodes}\\n    deg = {n: 0.0 for n in nodes}\\n    total_weight = 0.0\\n    for u, v, w in edges:\\n        w = float(w)\\n        total_weight += w\\n        adj[u][v] = adj[u].get(v, 0.0) + w\\n        adj[v][u] = adj[v].get(u, 0.0) + w\\n        deg[u] += w\\n        deg[v] += w\\n    M = total_weight  # sum of all edge weights = 2m in standard notation\\n    # initial communities\\n    c = {n: communities_in[n] for n in nodes}\\n    # community data\\n    e = collections.defaultdict(float)   # internal weight\\n    K = collections.defaultdict(float)   # sum of degrees\\n    for com in set(c.values()):\\n        e[com] = 0.0\\n        K[com] = 0.0\\n    for u, v, w in edges:\\n        w = float(w)\\n        if c[u] == c[v]:\\n            e[c[u]] += w\\n    for n in nodes:\\n        K[c[n]] += deg[n]\\n    moves = []\\n    changed = True\\n    while changed:\\n        changed = False\\n        for node in nodes:\\n            current = c[node]\\n            # compute weight to each neighbour community\\n            neigh_com = {}\\n            for nb, w in adj[node].items():\\n                com_nb = c[nb]\\n                if com_nb != current:\\n                    neigh_com[com_nb] = neigh_com.get(com_nb, 0.0) + w\\n            if not neigh_com:\\n                continue\\n            # degree of node\\n            k_i = deg[node]\\n            # search best gain\\n            best_gain = 0.0\\n            best_com = None\\n            for com, k_i_in_B in neigh_com.items():\\n                k_i_in_A = 0.0\\n                # compute weight from node to current community\\n                for nb, w in adj[node].items():\\n                    if c[nb] == current:\\n                        k_i_in_A += w\\n                # gain formula\\n                # (k_i_in_B - k_i_in_A)/M - 2*gamma*k_i*(K[com] - K[current] + k_i)/(M*M)\\n                # handle M=0\\n                if M == 0:\\n                    gain = 0.0\\n                else:\\n                    term1 = (k_i_in_B - k_i_in_A) / M\\n                    term2 = (2.0 * gamma * k_i * (K[com] - K[current] + k_i)) / (M * M)\\n                    gain = term1 - term2\\n                if gain > best_gain:\\n                    best_gain = gain\\n                    best_com = com\\n            if best_com is not None:\\n                # perform move\\n                new_com = best_com\\n                # recompute k_i_in_A and k_i_in_B for the chosen communities\\n                k_i_in_A = 0.0\\n                k_i_in_B = 0.0\\n                for nb, w in adj[node].items():\\n                    if c[nb] == current:\\n                        k_i_in_A += w\\n                    if c[nb] == new_com:\\n                        k_i_in_B += w\\n                moves.append({'from': current, 'node': node, 'to': new_com})\\n                # update community data\\n                e[current] -= k_i_in_A\\n                e[new_com] += k_i_in_B\\n                K[current] -= k_i\\n                K[new_com] += k_i\\n                # update node community\\n                c[node] = new_com\\n                changed = True\\n    # output communities (must have same keys as input)\\n    out_communities = {n: c[n] for n in nodes}\\n    return {'communities': out_communities, 'moves': moves}\"\n}\n```","reasoning_content":"We need to implement solve(case) for DATA-LEI-01. The case payload contains edges, communities, resolution, etc. The output must have two keys: communities and moves. The communities should be an object with dynamic keys 